{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_029_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2b2ed07bce59189edc8a5818f30ec742f6b6fba499b07b87c0d893138e7e18c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd9dca512d58e6a6f8073502eb44e384227dbebbb2660c0f577546d88374ad6",
      "text": "……电话打不通呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10022ed290e3958d27d1ef6712901c74db832f82540772b30aa4b1c68407c61a",
      "text": "唔……守护者们尚未归来吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1579e77143cdff37a484bd910b3ab9df21580f9eaa2227ed425c06d564f527d2",
      "text": "就算由我们去找父母，\n不知道外貌特征也很难办呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebabea1868073f5ddc9bc56610ced825263391267df8221e7c4179d9b6eb6a76",
      "text": "不过如果是在这附近走散的话，\n也许会有人来接。先观察一下情况吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:003d242a8f1631d2a5291f4138f4b1d5216b2cd56958a381a0cb74b7670e7e67",
      "text": "嗯！\n……不过，主能赶来真是帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3aa8eb2424f915fdb04d74b69618c68b7b45e70eadff05993f96174f36e9115",
      "text": "若仅吾与幼小之人独处，\n未免有些那个……放心不下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45aeff27515a61c69853a7e987fb95466d53242bd31fa8091763bf28c6c0f3cc",
      "text": "呐呐，大哥哥！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:926f6bc50b27894e1e11e234223f529c4d67ec1a38215400a74bd0a4a66be14b",
      "text": "哇！？……什、何事，幼小之人啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be2d4ef98325b42f53b6884211c23ce8babddb6c4d1dd51af1316a98f0cdb41f",
      "text": "大哥哥，为什么\n肩膀上要放个毛绒玩偶啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a1815af7824b75f15bce73ea3cfbb3715f19617f840a7b1bcaa8d99fadad854",
      "text": "唔。此非玩偶！\n乃背负尘世之罪孽的堕天使，撒旦是也！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0924285195940953dedfac96aabfc23624bf3e873c15e696bb929f692860bf9",
      "text": "哇……！\n撒旦好可爱哦！也借我玩玩嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
